---
/**
 * A full-page "here's a state, not the normal content" panel — the
 * permission-denied screen, a "SKYE isn't set up here" notice, etc.
 * Ships hidden; `showMessagePanel()` (src/lib/ui/messagePanel.ts) reveals
 * it via `showState`, sets `data-level`, and fills the two slots.
 *
 * Kept as a component (not built in TS) so the markup is reviewable HTML;
 * one instance is included per page that can show such a state.
 */
---

<section class="skye-message-panel" id="skye-message-panel" data-state hidden>
  <h1 data-slot="message-title"></h1>
  <p data-slot="message-body"></p>
</section>
